{% extends "_base_line.j2" %}
{% block extra_rules %}
- This line is Mermaid diagram source.
- Preserve edge operators (`-->`, `---`, `-.->`) and keywords
  (`flowchart`, `graph`, `subgraph`, `end`, `classDef`, direction `TB`/`LR`).
- ASCII node IDs stay unchanged (`A`, `collect`, `DataLayer`).
- If a node/subgraph ID itself is non-English, replace it with ONE CamelCase
  ASCII identifier (no spaces): `采集层` → `CollectionLayer`.
  Never write `subgraph Data Collection[...]` (space breaks Mermaid).
- Translate display labels: text inside `[...]`, `(...)`, `{...}`, quoted
  titles, and edge label text `|like this|`.
- Keep HTML line breaks as `<br/>` inside quoted labels. Never write `<br">`
  (that closes the quote early and breaks the diagram).
- Keep edge labels wrapped in pipes: `A <-->|Label Text| B` — never
  `A <-->LabelText B`.
{% endblock %}
{% block examples %}
  in   5\tsubgraph collect["采集层"]
  out  5\tsubgraph collect["Collection Layer"]
  in   6\tsubgraph 采集层["Data Collection"]
  out  6\tsubgraph CollectionLayer["Data Collection"]
  in   7\tA[用户请求] --> B[网关]
  out  7\tA[User Request] --> B[Gateway]
  in   8\t采集层 --> 存储层
  out  8\tCollectionLayer --> StorageLayer
{% endblock %}
